{"page":355,"width":1674,"height":2364,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"•미로","words":[{"text":"•미로","x":160,"y":179,"width":81,"height":34}]},{"text":"미로도 그래프를 이용하여 효과적으로 표현이 기능하다.","words":[{"text":"미로도","x":158,"y":244,"width":79,"height":31},{"text":"그래프를","x":247,"y":241,"width":110,"height":31},{"text":"이용하여","x":367,"y":241,"width":103,"height":32},{"text":"효과적으로","x":482,"y":241,"width":129,"height":31},{"text":"표현이","x":621,"y":240,"width":74,"height":32},{"text":"기능하다.","x":708,"y":239,"width":108,"height":32}]},{"text":"[그림 10%] 미로를 그래프로 표현한 예","words":[{"text":"[그림","x":152,"y":848,"width":51,"height":29},{"text":"10%]","x":214,"y":846,"width":60,"height":28},{"text":"미로를","x":292,"y":848,"width":62,"height":24},{"text":"그래프로","x":362,"y":848,"width":85,"height":23},{"text":"표현한","x":454,"y":847,"width":63,"height":24},{"text":"예","x":525,"y":847,"width":19,"height":24}]},{"text":"•선수과목","words":[{"text":"•선수과목","x":155,"y":943,"width":136,"height":32}]},{"text":"대학교에서 전공괴목을 수강하기 위해서는 미리 들어야 하는 선수과목들이 있다. 그래프는 이러","words":[{"text":"대학교에서","x":152,"y":1003,"width":128,"height":32},{"text":"전공괴목을","x":295,"y":1002,"width":133,"height":30},{"text":"수강하기","x":437,"y":1002,"width":102,"height":31},{"text":"위해서는","x":552,"y":1003,"width":104,"height":31},{"text":"미리","x":667,"y":1002,"width":48,"height":31},{"text":"들어야","x":728,"y":1001,"width":80,"height":31},{"text":"하는","x":817,"y":1001,"width":53,"height":31},{"text":"선수과목들이","x":881,"y":998,"width":157,"height":32},{"text":"있다.","x":1052,"y":996,"width":58,"height":32},{"text":"그래프는","x":1123,"y":995,"width":110,"height":31},{"text":"이러","x":1243,"y":994,"width":51,"height":32}]},{"text":"한 선수과목 관계를 효과적으로 표현할 수 있다.","words":[{"text":"한","x":150,"y":1057,"width":26,"height":30},{"text":"선수과목","x":186,"y":1055,"width":106,"height":31},{"text":"관계를","x":301,"y":1054,"width":80,"height":30},{"text":"효과적으로","x":390,"y":1055,"width":133,"height":30},{"text":"표현할","x":531,"y":1056,"width":80,"height":30},{"text"